、资：‘谁可与太尉对者？’放曰：‘曹爽。’帝曰：‘堪其事不？’爽在左右，流汗不能对。放蹑其足，耳之曰：‘臣以死奉社稷！’","attribution":"正文","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f69dd3b4e827e95f0087","start":10,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-ce99c0411097dcb9d6fb","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-a638d9784fc427a6f989","layer":"pei","quote":"按《世语》所云树置先后，与本传不同","attribution":"裴注·注家按语","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f69dd3b4e827e95f0087","start":306,"end":323,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
